{"id":"kimi-compaction-ledger","ord":"a0","title":"The kimi-k3 compaction ledger — pi vs opencode","desc":"THE EXPERIMENT, CLOSED (opened by the human 2026-08-31; ruled by them 2026-09-01): pi and opencode alternated as the kimi-k3 commodity author with every auto-compaction incident recorded here, and the human ruled for OPENCODE — it replaces pi as the implementor; pi stays a reviewer. The record that decided it: pi — three overflows in one lane on 2026-08-31 (all survived), a fourth on odu-doorbell 2026-09-01 (outcome pending at the ruling), plus two raw-token-spill session restarts the same day; opencode — one overflow on odu-checkout-targeting, survived fully coherent mid-refactor. The ledger stays as history; new incidents still land here while any kimi agent authors.","created":"2026-08-31T12:53:10-04:00","changed":"2026-09-02T17:36:09-04:00"}
